  "description": "The Auron E-mail component is an easy to use COM based API for sending and receiving E-mails. \n\nThe most important features:\n  * Easy to use API\n  * Support for SMTP, POP3 and IMAP;    \n  * Full support for OAuth2 on all protocols;\n  * Parse, Load and Save MIME encoded emails;\n  * Full TLS/SSL support on all protocols;\n  * Includes OAuth2 authorization API;\n  * Customized search/fetch requests are supported for IMAP;\n  * IPv6 support;\n  * Excellent logging and tracing available for troubleshooting\n  * Use in many development environments; e.g: .Net, C++, Delphi, and more",
